        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thom Yorke, Bruce Guthro\n- Bands: Radiohead, Runrig\n- Roles: musician, composer, singer, songwriter\n- Places: England, Cape Breton Island, Nova Scotia, Scotland\n\nFacts:\n- Thom Yorke was born on 7 October 1968.\n- Bruce Guthro was born as Bruce Guthrie on 31 August 1961.\n- Thom Yorke is an English musician and composer.\n- Thom Yorke is best known as the singer and principal songwriter of the alternative rock band Radiohead.\n- Bruce Guthro is a Canadian singer-songwriter from Cape Breton Island, Nova Scotia.\n- Bruce Guthro recorded as a solo artist.\n- In 1998, Bruce Guthro joined the Scottish folk rock band Runrig while continuing his solo career.",
